                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " in Environmental Health News:\n\n"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "A secretive Cold War lab exposed thousands to radiation without consent",
                                "style": {
                                    "bold": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "\nNov 27, 2024\n\nA San Francisco Navy lab knowingly exposed more than 1,000 workers and servicemen to radiation during Cold War-era experiments, leaving a toxic legacy still felt in nearby communities today.\n"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "link",
                                "url": "https:\/\/www.sfpublicpress.org\/exposed\/",
                                "text": "Chris Roberts and Rebecca Rowe report in a multipart print and podcast series for "
